or:#fff\">浮层卡片</span></span></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">展示型登录页，但表单边界必须清楚</div><div class=\"mk \"><span style=\"display:block;width:110px;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4338ca,#7c3aed)\"><span style=\"display:block;background:rgba(255,255,255,.14);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;font-size:12px;color:#fff;text-align:center\">登 录</span></span></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">作品集和主题页面，局部增加轻盈层次</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:rgba(124,58,237,.25);border:1px solid rgba(124,58,237,.35)\"></span><span style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:rgba(236,72,153,.25);border:1px solid rgba(236,72,153,.35)\"></span><span style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:rgba(249,115,22,.25);border:1px solid rgba(249,115,22,.35)\"></span></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">把长篇正文直接放在复杂模糊背景上</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><span style=\"display:block;width:110px;padding:6px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#4338ca,#ec4899)\"><span style=\"display:block;background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:6px;padding:5px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:96%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.5)\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:92%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.5)\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:95%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.5)\"></i></span></span></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">没有层级需求时仍让所有区域变成玻璃</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><span style=\"display:block;width:80px;height:36px;border-radius:8px;background:#f0f0f2;position:relative\"><i s